    "name": "Who am I?",
    "steam_appid": 3448240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>&quot;Who am I ?&quot; is a first-person psychological horror game with a linear narrative and an average playtime of 50-60 minutes to complete.</u></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Story</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You step into the shoes of Mark, a man trapped in a life he never dreamed of living. After receiving a letter announcing the death of his aunt, he decides to travel to his childhood home in search of answers and, perhaps, a chance to change his fate. However, what he finds is a place filled with buried secrets and\u00a0terrifying memories.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is primarily a first-person walking simulator, with elements of exploration and interaction designed to immerse the player in an oppressive and mystery-laden atmosphere. As you progress, you will explore the rooms of the house, uncovering the fragments of the\u00a0 story.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Game Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Immersive and unsettling atmosphere</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore various locations</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Complete different tasks </i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solve the mystery</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Engage in psychological tension </i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In-depth narrative and psychological horror elements</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Minimalistic gameplay mechanics</i></strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>&quot;Who am I ?&quot; is a first-person psychological horror game with a linear narrative and an average playtime of 50-60 minutes to complete.</u></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Story</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You step into the shoes of Mark, a man trapped in a life he never dreamed of living. After receiving a letter announcing the death of his aunt, he decides to travel to his childhood home in search of answers and, perhaps, a chance to change his fate. However, what he finds is a place filled with buried secrets and\u00a0terrifying memories.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is primarily a first-person walking simulator, with elements of exploration and interaction designed to immerse the player in an oppressive and mystery-laden atmosphere. As you progress, you will explore the rooms of the house, uncovering the fragments of the\u00a0 story.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Game Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Immersive and unsettling atmosphere</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore various locations</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Complete different tasks </i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solve the mystery</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Engage in psychological tension </i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In-depth narrative and psychological horror elements</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Minimalistic gameplay mechanics</i></strong></p></li></ul>",
